* JRC4558 / NJM4558 + BD139/BD140 audio experiment, +/-6 V, gain 11
* Derived from bd139-amp.net; original extracted files are unchanged.
* Device reference: https://www.nisshinbo-microdevices.co.jp/en/products/operational-amplifier/spec/?product=njm4558
* Dual DIP-8: out A=1, in- A=2, in+ A=3, V-=4, V+=8.
* Unused B: pin 5 to ground, connect pin 6 to pin 7.
* Check actual manufacturer's package datasheet before wiring.
* Model terminals below are FUNCTIONAL, not physical pin numbers.
* Uses generic educational approximation, NOT a manufacturer model.
* GBW is illustrative; headroom, Rout and DC gain are generic assumptions.
* No slew rate, input bias, noise, current limit, or crossover model.
* This simulation CANNOT rank the actual ICs' sound quality or stability.
* Diode bias/base drive and thermal behavior require hardware evaluation.

.PARAM V_RAIL=6.0
.PARAM R_LOAD=8

* --- POWER RAILS ---
V_CC VCC 0 DC {V_RAIL}
V_EE VEE 0 DC {-V_RAIL}

* --- INPUT SIGNAL ---
V_IN Audio_In 0 DC 0 AC 1 SIN(0 0.05 1000)
C_IN Audio_In Opamp_In 1uF
R_BIAS Opamp_In 0 10k

* --- OP-AMP AND GLOBAL FEEDBACK ---
X_Opamp Opamp_In FB VCC VEE Opamp_Out OPAMP_APPROX PARAMS: GBW=3Meg
R_IN FB 0 1k
R_F  FB Amp_Out 10k

* --- OPTIMIZED BIAS NETWORK (Lower Resistor Values for Higher Base Drive) ---
R_B1 VCC Base_NPN 3.3k
D1 Base_NPN Driver_Node 1N4148
D2 Driver_Node Base_PNP 1N4148
R_B2 Base_PNP VEE 3.3k
V_DRV Opamp_Out Driver_Node 0

* --- OUTPUT STAGE (BD139 / BD140) ---
R_STOP_N Base_NPN QBase_NPN 47
R_STOP_P Base_PNP QBase_PNP 47
Q_NPN Collector_NPN QBase_NPN Emitter_NPN BD139
Q_PNP Collector_PNP QBase_PNP Emitter_PNP BD140

V_SENSE_POS VCC Collector_NPN 0V
V_SENSE_NEG VEE Collector_PNP 0V

R_E1 Emitter_NPN Amp_Out 0.47
R_E2 Emitter_PNP Amp_Out 0.47
R_L Amp_Out 0 {R_LOAD}

* --- DECOUPLING CAPACITORS ---
C_DEC1 VCC 0 100uF
C_DEC2 VEE 0 100uF
C_HF_POS VCC 0 100n
C_HF_NEG VEE 0 100n
R_ZOBEL Amp_Out Zobel 10
C_ZOBEL Zobel 0 100n

* --- MODELS & SIMULATION COMMANDS ---
.MODEL BD139 NPN(IS=2.3E-13 BF=160 VAF=100 IKF=1.5 ISE=1E-13 NE=1.5 BR=4 RC=0.1 CJE=80p CJC=50p TF=1n)
.MODEL BD140 PNP(IS=2.3E-13 BF=160 VAF=100 IKF=1.5 ISE=1E-13 NE=1.5 BR=4 RC=0.1 CJE=80p CJC=50p TF=1n)
.MODEL 1N4148 D(Is=2.52n Rs=.568 N=1.752 Cjo=4p M=.4 Vj=.6 Fc=.5 Tt=20n)

* Generic one-pole op-amp approximation; deliberately incomplete.
.SUBCKT OPAMP_APPROX INP INM VP VM OUT PARAMS: GBW=1Meg
E_OPEN Open 0 INP INM 100k
R_POLE Open Filtered 1k
C_POLE Filtered 0 {100k/(6.283185307*GBW*1k)}
B_LIMIT Drive 0 V=min(max(V(Filtered),V(VM)+1.5),V(VP)-1.5)
R_OUT Drive OUT 50
.ENDS OPAMP_APPROX

.TRAN 2u 20m 0 2u
.PRINT TRAN V(Audio_In) V(Amp_Out)
.AC DEC 40 10 1Meg
.PRINT AC VM(Amp_Out)
.END
